# scripts/opcount: `rawbench bench N` reads an MCP tools/call request N
# times into a record whose id and params are json.Raw (wf10 JSON-RAW),
# and writes the record back; the cost of one request is the slope
# between the two sizes. The control is hand Go: the same struct with
# json.RawMessage fields, read by json.Unmarshal and written by
# json.Marshal.
unit request
sizes 20000 120000
args bench {n}
control benchmarks/jsonraw/testdata/control
